{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"dede-and-the-puddle","version":1,"title":"Dede and the Puddle","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Pitter, patter, pitter, patter. The rain fell on the tin roof. Dede watched from the door.","sentences":["Pitter, patter, pitter, patter.","The rain fell on the tin roof.","Dede watched from the door."],"image":"sha256:ef76aaf0fc67aa216461120fcfa08caf986aee62b499a1f4712c96f2f0a6f527","alt":"A small girl in a green dress stands in a doorway watching rain fall on a tin roof.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:0ec75b4be9d425d221168514d5b9ded36ef3b21c258786df69c7368408bd916a","durationMs":8480,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3786],[3786,6360],[6360,8480]],"words":[[0,833],[833,1666],[1666,2499],[2499,3786],[3786,4013],[4013,4316],[4316,4619],[4619,4770],[4770,4997],[4997,5224],[5224,6360],[6360,6663],[6663,7193],[7193,7496],[7496,7723],[7723,8480]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Then the rain stopped. Outside, a big brown puddle shone like a mirror.","sentences":["Then the rain stopped.","Outside, a big brown puddle shone like a mirror."],"image":"sha256:e5751c0fb0858786015e0130c4247a4cc0ba28cea4337b1bf3021ba392a45f69","alt":"A wide brown puddle reflects the bright sky in a swept yard.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:45ffed8c1b5a1b13011cf9e97043783635a5ee0b2a4aa61044c65c4ff484ea40","durationMs":7280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2639],[2639,7280]],"words":[[0,364],[364,637],[637,1001],[1001,2639],[2639,3731],[3731,3913],[3913,4186],[4186,4641],[4641,5187],[5187,5642],[5642,6006],[6006,6188],[6188,7280]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Dede put on her red boots. Splash! Splash, splash, splash!","sentences":["Dede put on her red boots.","Splash!","Splash, splash, splash!"],"image":"sha256:35919f0a9417bdc329bca71c790a650a4dae72186e7079b9616dabf0db79d1f9","alt":"The girl in red rain boots jumps in the puddle and water flies up around her.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:8a9de72c8fc51c9d089ec121a15617e87b9b674d46b5f94e48cd24f7b62ecb39","durationMs":7280,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2751],[2751,4260],[4260,7280]],"words":[[0,355],[355,621],[621,799],[799,1065],[1065,1331],[1331,2751],[2751,4260],[4260,5237],[5237,6214],[6214,7280]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"She saw a face in the water. It was Dede! She waved. The face waved back.","sentences":["She saw a face in the water.","It was Dede!","She waved.","The face waved back."],"image":"sha256:d6ec0ba4569d3720b08cda79280550899553a4949ec97279af212d4b8d248fd3","alt":"The girl leans over the puddle and sees her own smiling reflection.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:14fd65d0f29b288afaf752b39c5f73b6c363793a6cc9c8d682b5f9df3cba7e0d","durationMs":7880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2765],[2765,4441],[4441,6033],[6033,7880]],"words":[[0,251],[251,502],[502,670],[670,1005],[1005,1173],[1173,1424],[1424,2765],[2765,2933],[2933,3184],[3184,4441],[4441,4692],[4692,6033],[6033,6284],[6284,6619],[6619,7038],[7038,7880]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"A yellow butterfly sat on the edge. Dede stood very still. The butterfly took a tiny sip.","sentences":["A yellow butterfly sat on the edge.","Dede stood very still.","The butterfly took a tiny sip."],"image":"sha256:c6f2d306e568609db8fdd656362a2eecd964766032790dd686d4788c086d9b7a","alt":"A yellow butterfly rests on the puddle’s edge as the girl watches quietly.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:221746af73079cf6fb699d87ef9b0e7883980ef129335b0da8d799b09cc7aea9","durationMs":9640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3856],[3856,6652],[6652,9640]],"words":[[0,193],[193,771],[771,1639],[1639,1928],[1928,2121],[2121,2410],[2410,3856],[3856,4242],[4242,4724],[4724,5110],[5110,6652],[6652,6941],[6941,7809],[7809,8195],[8195,8388],[8388,8774],[8774,9640]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Dede went to play with her doll. After lunch she ran back. The puddle was small. Then it was smaller.","sentences":["Dede went to play with her doll.","After lunch she ran back.","The puddle was small.","Then it was smaller."],"image":"sha256:4dc6e9a81ad03e7ad28e22a24b97d12b271c52a58ec77ce3a41ec80dae8126eb","alt":"The girl looks down at a much smaller puddle under a hot, bright sun.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:74cd97d94516a04446cb7babe660d5e9209e731bbacdc6cfa8b109740e76a45b","durationMs":10080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3102],[3102,5772],[5772,8183],[8183,10080]],"words":[[0,345],[345,690],[690,862],[862,1207],[1207,1552],[1552,1810],[1810,3102],[3102,3533],[3533,3964],[3964,4222],[4222,4480],[4480,5772],[5772,6030],[6030,6547],[6547,6805],[6805,8183],[8183,8528],[8528,8700],[8700,8958],[8958,10080]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"‘Where did my puddle go?’ asked Dede. Mama said, ‘The warm sun lifted the water up into the sky.’","sentences":["‘Where did my puddle go?’ asked Dede.","Mama said, ‘The warm sun lifted the water up into the sky.’"],"image":"sha256:ef5127f7539a0e0f78e191a87615df4ce9d340a9bd7debec7a56d22cf7d1c2da","alt":"Mama points upward while the girl looks puzzled beside a nearly dry patch of earth.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e0abf8a0f8227af93ceca46da256162a4e5f3c8a3ca45245a0025dd8efbb2d18","durationMs":9640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4540],[4540,9640]],"words":[[0,463],[463,741],[741,926],[926,1482],[1482,2687],[2687,3150],[3150,4540],[4540,4911],[4911,5745],[5745,6023],[6023,6394],[6394,6672],[6672,7228],[7228,7506],[7506,7969],[7969,8154],[8154,8525],[8525,8803],[8803,9640]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Dede looked up at the sky. ‘Come back, rain,’ she whispered. ‘I will be ready.’ The end.","sentences":["Dede looked up at the sky.","‘Come back, rain,’ she whispered.","‘I will be ready.’ The end."],"image":"sha256:ec9a354038d27e401c40db9c1e070d09860307af8fbbc677d3ad168c4304c67b","alt":"The girl looks up at a few soft clouds, wearing her red boots, smiling hopefully.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e9b194540e6880dd4c598f3b9905d221ebcb03a36c438e6e03184b1cb0519592","durationMs":9520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2635],[2635,6460],[6460,9520]],"words":[[0,340],[340,850],[850,1020],[1020,1190],[1190,1445],[1445,2635],[2635,2975],[2975,3740],[3740,4505],[4505,4760],[4760,6460],[6460,6630],[6630,6970],[6970,7140],[7140,8500],[8500,8755],[8755,9520]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"puddle-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"What colour were Dede’s boots?","options":["Red","Blue","Yellow"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"puddle-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":2,"targetSound":"p","prompt":"Which words start with the p sound, like puddle?","options":["puddle","patter","sun","boots"],"correctIndexes":[0,1]},{"id":"puddle-p1","type":"prediction","afterPage":6,"prompt":"Where do you think the puddle went? Tell a friend your idea."},{"id":"puddle-s1","type":"sequencing","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["The rain stopped.","Dede splashed in the puddle.","The puddle got smaller."]},{"id":"puddle-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Dede felt a little sad when the puddle went. What do you do when something you love is finished?","feelingOptions":["Sad","Hopeful","Curious","Cross"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"puddle","definition":"A small pool of water on the ground after rain.","pages":[2,6]},{"word":"butterfly","definition":"An insect with colourful wings.","pages":[5]},{"word":"sip","definition":"A very small drink.","pages":[5]}],"assets":{"sha256:0ec75b4be9d425d221168514d5b9ded36ef3b21c258786df69c7368408bd916a":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/0ec75b4be9d4.mp3","bytes":34413,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:ef76aaf0fc67aa216461120fcfa08caf986aee62b499a1f4712c96f2f0a6f527":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/dede-and-the-puddle/page1-1.webp","bytes":54822,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:45ffed8c1b5a1b13011cf